					&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;FERC accounting does not require recognition of uncertainty in income taxes for temporary tax differences. If this report were prepared according to GAAP, the following FERC account categories would be impacted as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;March 31&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, respectively:&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
