					&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;FERC accounting does not require the reclassification of cloud computing hosting arrangement costs. If such reclassifications were recognized according to GAAP, the following FERC account categories would be impacted as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;31&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, respectively:&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
