			&lt;ul type="disc" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:59.52pt; padding-left:7.48pt; font-family:serif; font-size:12pt; -aw-font-family:'Symbol'; -aw-font-weight:normal; -aw-number-format:'&amp;#xF0B7;'"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;FERC Form No.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;1 includes interdepartmental revenue accounts 4480001 (electric) and 4840001 (gas). These interdepartmental revenues are eliminated for GAAP reporting. Below are the account balances for the three months ended &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;6,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
