				&lt;/table&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-left:63.35pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:-18pt; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font:7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;Includes long-term debt due within one year. Excludes debt issuance costs and unamortized discount of $4.8 million and $4.3 million as of March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;31, 2026, and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;31, 2025, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;ol start="2" type="a" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-top:10pt; margin-left:41.99pt; page-break-after:avoid; padding-left:3.36pt; font-family:Calibri; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span&gt;Recurring Fair Value Measurements.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-left:45.35pt; margin-bottom:0pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;The following table presents the balances of assets and liabilities measured at fair value on a recurring basis for MGE.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-left:45.35pt; margin-bottom:0pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&#xD;
