				&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font:7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;MGE's exchange-traded derivative contracts, over-the-counter party transactions, purchased power agreement, and FTRs are subject to regulatory deferral. These derivatives are therefore marked to fair value and are offset in the financial statements with a corresponding regulatory asset or liability.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
